<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Maya × Kai — March 8, 2026</title>
    
    <!-- YAML Metadata
    ---
    title: "Maya & Kai Wedding"
    date: "2026-03-08"
    venue: "Ace Hotel, Brooklyn"
    style: "editorial-bold"
    template: "untitled-format-v1"
    designers: "Sadie Bosworth Atelier"
    ---
    -->
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --color-primary: #1a1a1a;
            --color-accent: #ff4d4d;
            --color-secondary: #6b6b6b;
            --color-background: #fafafa;
            --font-display: 'Impact', 'Arial Black', sans-serif;
            --font-body: 'Helvetica', 'Arial', sans-serif;
        }
        
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: var(--font-body);
            background: var(--color-background);
            color: var(--color-primary);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        
        .hero {
            height: 100vh;
            background: var(--color-primary);
            color: var(--color-background);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .hero::before {
            content: '×';
            position: absolute;
            font-size: 50vw;
            opacity: 0.03;
            font-family: var(--font-display);
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        
        .hero-content {
            text-align: center;
            z-index: 2;
            padding: 2rem;
        }
        
        .label {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.3em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }
        
        .couple-names {
            font-family: var(--font-display);
            font-size: clamp(3rem, 15vw, 10rem);
            line-height: 0.9;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .separator {
            display: block;
            color: var(--color-accent);
            font-size: 0.5em;
            margin: 0.3rem 0;
        }
        
        .date-location {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }
        
        .location-name {
            color: var(--color-accent);
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        
        section {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 5rem 2rem;
        }
        
        .section-number {
            font-family: var(--font-display);
            font-size: 4rem;
            color: var(--color-accent);
            opacity: 0.2;
            margin-bottom: -1rem;
        }
        
        h2 {
            font-family: var(--font-display);
            font-size: 3rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }
        
        .two-column {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            margin: 3rem 0;
        }
        
        .info-block {
            background: white;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }
        
        .info-block h3 {
            font-family: var(--font-display);
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        }
        
        .info-block p {
            line-height: 1.8;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }
        
        .highlight-text {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            max-width: 800px;
            font-weight: 300;
        }
        
        .schedule-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            margin: 3rem 0;
        }
        
        .schedule-card {
            background: var(--color-primary);
            color: var(--color-background);
            padding: 2rem;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .schedule-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 4px;
            background: var(--color-accent);
        }
        
        .schedule-time {
            font-family: var(--font-display);
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--color-accent);
        }
        
        .schedule-event {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        .schedule-detail {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            opacity: 0.8;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        
        .full-width-section {
            background: var(--color-primary);
            color: var(--color-background);
            padding: 6rem 2rem;
            margin: 5rem 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .full-width-section h2 {
            color: var(--color-background);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .full-width-section p {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        
        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 1.2rem 3rem;
            background: var(--color-accent);
            color: var(--color-background);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-family: var(--font-display);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        
        .cta-button:hover {
            background: #ff6b6b;
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
        
        .quote-section {
            background: white;
            padding: 4rem;
            margin: 4rem 0;
            border-left: 8px solid var(--color-accent);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        
        .quote-text {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
            font-weight: 300;
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--color-secondary);
        }
        
        .faq-list {
            list-style: none;
            margin: 3rem 0;
        }
        
        .faq-item {
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            padding-bottom: 2rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
        }
        
        .faq-question {
            font-family: var(--font-display);
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--color-primary);
        }
        
        .faq-answer {
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: var(--color-secondary);
        }
        
        footer {
            background: var(--color-primary);
            color: var(--color-background);
            padding: 4rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .footer-names {
            font-family: var(--font-display);
            font-size: 2rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--color-accent);
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .couple-names {
                font-size: 3rem;
            }
            
            .two-column,
            .schedule-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 2rem;
            }
            
            h2 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
            
            .section-number {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }
            
            .quote-section {
                padding: 2rem;
            }
            
            .quote-text {
                font-size: 1.3rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <p class="label">You're Invited</p>
            <h1 class="couple-names">
                MAYA
                <span class="separator">×</span>
                KAI
            </h1>
            <p class="date-location">
                03.08.2026 / <span class="location-name">BROOKLYN</span>
            </p>
        </div>
    </header>
    
    <main>
        <section id="intro">
            <div class="section-number">01</div>
            <h2>The Details</h2>
            <p class="highlight-text">
                We're getting married and throwing the kind of party we'd actually want to attend. 
                Think rooftop views, good food, better music, and the people we love most. 
                No stuffy traditions. Just us, you, and a damn good time.
            </p>
        </section>
        
        <section id="venue">
            <div class="section-number">02</div>
            <h2>Where We're Doing This</h2>
            
            <div class="two-column">
                <div class="info-block">
                    <h3>Venue</h3>
                    <p>
                        <strong>Ace Hotel Brooklyn</strong><br>
                        Rooftop & Event Space<br>
                        252 Schermerhorn Street<br>
                        Brooklyn, NY 11201
                    </p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="info-block">
                    <h3>Getting There</h3>
                    <p>
                        Subway: A/C/G to Hoyt-Schermerhorn<br>
                        2/3 to Hoyt Street<br>
                        Street parking available<br>
                        Uber/Lyft to "Ace Hotel Brooklyn"
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="info-block" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
                <h3>What to Wear</h3>
                <p>
                    <strong>Dress Code:</strong> Creative black tie. Wear something that makes you feel like the main character. 
                    We'll be on a rooftop, so maybe skip the stilettos. 
                    The vibe is fashion-forward, not formal.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>
        
        <section id="schedule">
            <div class="section-number">03</div>
            <h2>Timeline</h2>
            
            <div class="schedule-grid">
                <div class="schedule-card">
                    <div class="schedule-time">6:00</div>
                    <div class="schedule-event">Arrive</div>
                    <div class="schedule-detail">
                        Grab a drink, hit the rooftop, enjoy golden hour over the city
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="schedule-card">
                    <div class="schedule-time">6:30</div>
                    <div class="schedule-event">Ceremony</div>
                    <div class="schedule-detail">
                        Quick and sweet. We promise. Then straight to celebrating.
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="schedule-card">
                    <div class="schedule-time">7:00</div>
                    <div class="schedule-event">Cocktails</div>
                    <div class="schedule-detail">
                        Craft cocktails, small bites, Brooklyn sunset views
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="schedule-card">
                    <div class="schedule-time">8:00</div>
                    <div class="schedule-event">Dinner</div>
                    <div class="schedule-detail">
                        Sit-down situation. Locally sourced. Chef's tasting menu.
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="schedule-card">
                    <div class="schedule-time">10:00</div>
                    <div class="schedule-event">Dance</div>
                    <div class="schedule-detail">
                        DJ set. Open bar. Dance like nobody's watching (they are).
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="schedule-card">
                    <div class="schedule-time">1:00</div>
                    <div class="schedule-event">After Party</div>
                    <div class="schedule-detail">
                        For the night owls. Location TBA. If you know, you know.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        
        <section class="quote-section">
            <p class="quote-text">
                "Marriage is not about finding someone you can live with. 
                It's about finding someone you can't imagine living without."
            </p>
        </section>
        
        <section id="faq">
            <div class="section-number">04</div>
            <h2>FAQ</h2>
            
            <ul class="faq-list">
                <li class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">Can I bring a plus one?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        If your invitation says "and guest," absolutely. 
                        Otherwise, we're keeping it intimate. No hard feelings.
                    </div>
                </li>
                
                <li class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">Are kids invited?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        We love your kids, but this is an adults-only affair. 
                        Think of it as a night off. You're welcome.
                    </div>
                </li>
                
                <li class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">What about photos?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        We've got a photographer. Feel free to snap away, 
                        but please keep phones down during the ceremony. 
                        Tag us @mayaxkai on Instagram after!
                    </div>
                </li>
                
                <li class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">Hotel recommendations?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Stay at the Ace Hotel (literally downstairs from the party). 
                        Use code MAYAKAI for a discount. Or check out: 
                        1 Hotel Brooklyn Bridge, The Hoxton Williamsburg, 
                        or any Airbnb in Boerum Hill/Brooklyn Heights.
                    </div>
                </li>
                
                <li class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question">Gift registry?</div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Your presence is enough. But if you insist: 
                        we have a Zola registry and we're also saving for 
                        a honeymoon in Japan. Links on our website.
                    </div>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>
        
        <section class="full-width-section">
            <h2>RSVP Required</h2>
            <p>
                Let us know if you can make it by <strong>January 15, 2026</strong>
            </p>
            <p>
                We need a headcount for food, drinks, and general party planning purposes. 
                Hit the button below to confirm.
            </p>
            <a href="mailto:rsvp@mayaxkai.com" class="cta-button">Count Me In</a>
        </section>
    </main>
    
    <footer>
        <p class="footer-names">MAYA × KAI</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.7;">
            03.08.2026 • Brooklyn, NY
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 0.75rem; opacity: 0.5;">
            Designed by Sadie Bosworth Atelier • Living Invitations<br>
            Built with Untitled Format™
        </p>
    </footer>
</body>

</html>